Hi Zdenek,

Update on May 2024 Joint PWG/OP Summit from today's PWG Steering Committee
call.

Our current tentative plan is a Hybrid hosted by Lexmark (in Lexington,
Kentucky, USA)
on Monday 6 May 2024 through Wednesday 8 May 2024

Zdenek, please note that we usually have PWG Plenary on the first morning
and then
OP topics for the rest of the first day and into the afternoon of the
second day.  See for
example:

https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/may-2023-virtual.html

The PWG SC members who can travel in person (most or all of us) could all
travel to
Lexington, so that location was chosen, instead of Sunnyvale, California.

Zdenek, Till, Aveek, and Danny - please reply with your thoughts ASAP,
since US visas
are *extremely* delayed (4-6 months in many countries) at present.

Cheers,
- Ira

